    "title": "Sudan says army destroys Emirati aircraft, killing 40 mercenaries - NewsBreak",
    "text": "Sudan says army destroys Emirati aircraft, killing 40 mercenaries\nBy AFP AFP,\n8 hours agoSudan's air force has destroyed an Emirati aircraft carrying Colombian mercenaries as it landed at a paramilitary-controlled airport in Darfur, killing at least 40 people, the army-aligned state TV said Wednesday. A military source, speaking to AFP on condition of anonymity, said the UAE plane \"was bombed and completely destroyed\"...",
